# CPU Cooler listing + PDP required info

Every CPU Cooler (category slug `cpu-cooler`) must expose structured specs and show them on the **listing card** and **PDP**. Do not ship a cooler card that is only a title + price.

## Required structured specs

| Key | Listing card | PDP section |
|-----|--------------|-------------|
| `cooler_type` | Type fallback | Key Features (Type) |
| `fan_speed_detail` | Fan Speed | Key Features |
| `airflow` | Fan Airflow | Key Features |
| `noise_level` | Noise | Key Features |
| `air_pressure` | — | Key Features |
| `connector` | — | Key Features |
| `others` | — | Key Features |
| `dimension` | — | Physical Specification |
| `weight` | — | Physical Specification |
| `intel_sockets` | compatibility line | Supported Sockets (Intel) |
| `amd_sockets` | compatibility line | Supported Sockets (AMD) |
| `warranty` | — | Warranty Information (required) |

Use `getCpuCoolerListingCardLines()` for category cards. Prefer `shortDescription` listing bullets when present.

## PDP

Star Tech order: **Key Features** → **Physical Specification** → **Supported Sockets** → **Warranty Information**. Warranty key `warranty` (fallback **No Warranty**). Show up to **3 local gallery images**.

## Import / CMS

- Category slug: `cpu-cooler`
- Local images: `/uploads/cpu-coolers/<slug>.<ext>`, `<slug>-2`, `<slug>-3`
- Scripts: `scrape-startech-cpu-cooler-list.ts`, `import-cpu-cooler-json.ts`, `download-cpu-cooler-images.ts`

## Do not

- Drop `warranty`, `fan_speed_detail`, or socket fields
- Show cooler listing cards without highlight bullets when data exists
- Hotlink Star Tech images as the permanent CMS URL
